'''Scalebane Ridge''' is a Dark Iron hunting camp located on the cliffs of the eastern [[Badlands]] overlooking [[Lethlor Ravine]]. Led by [[Kegdesh Foulmantle]], these greedy whelp hunters and dragon skinners have carved a treacherous ridge, hunting drake trophies and boldly seeking profit for Shadowforge amid scorching cliffs.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

